00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:22.419
the impeachment hearings from last week were
not the fireworks that we had maybe hoped

00:00:22.419 --> 00:00:24.750
for or thought there were going to be last
week.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:28.550
If I had to really sum it up, I would say
we got corroboration of a lot of stuff we

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.891
suspected and then we had one new piece of
information, which was about a phone call

00:00:32.891 --> 00:00:38.050
