Donald Trump, which took place while Sundland

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.050
was in a restaurant.

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:40.880
That phone call may have been surveilled by
Russian intelligence.

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:45.610
We found out, uh, and bill Taylor's staffer
overheard that phone call.

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.690
That call has since been corroborated.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:48.690
It happened.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:52.570
That's part of what we now have more information
relating to.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:54.690
Things changed this week.

00:00:54.690 --> 00:01:00.160
Yesterday's testimony was much different and
it was very devastating to the Trump narrative.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.600
Now, whether it will do anything as another
question we've already discussed, but let's

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:04.989
