We had Lieutenant Colonel Alexander Veneman
credible, clearly trustworthy, careful not

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:14.750
to say more than what he can defend with facts
and personal knowledge.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:19.270
Still, they were smearing and active duty
member of the military because they didn't

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:22.100
like what he said, and we'll get to that a
little bit later.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:25.729
Every witness yesterday confirmed a part of
