00:01:37.299 --> 00:01:41.719
Yesterday we had Lieutenant Colonel Veneman
and Jennifer Williams who are now firsthand

00:01:41.719 --> 00:01:43.759
witnesses to the July 25 phone call.

00:01:43.759 --> 00:01:46.909
