00:01:46.909 --> 00:01:53.720
Nobody has firsthand knowledge that changed
yesterday I had told you the July 25 phone

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:55.900
call is not the whole story.

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:58.830
You can't just look at that to determine if
